para('In practical terms the driving route is mobilisation/survey → early material definition → procurement → BHS fabrication → BHS transport and installation/service acceptance → old BHS demolition → ICP–ICG installation → residual removal/offshore punch → dossiers and final acceptance. This is scenario logic, not proof of actual productivity or approved method feasibility.')
