para('Sensitivity is a conservative calendar stress test: the10dayreserve is modeled as a seasonalcapacityhold, and marine tasks cannot use the closed season. A few days can move remaining work toOctober. It is not a probabilistic forecast. A robust baseline needs validated workability, safe stopping/revalidation and an agreed demob strategy, plus greater earlyseasonmargin or evidenced recovery.')
